      `another fee is prescribed for the document by this Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the document is an Order for Review of Detention` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 4 part 1 item 17 the fee is payable` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the document is sealed or issued`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "On sealing or issuing any document"
    ELSE IF `the document is a judgment or order`
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "not being a judgment or order"
         ELSE IF `another fee is prescribed for the document by this Schedule`
              THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where no other fee is prescribed by this Schedule"
              ELSE IF `the document is an Order for Review of Detention`
                   THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Provided that this fee is not payable on an Order for Review of Detention"
                   ELSE JUST TRUE

